## Definition of Done

Before declaring work complete, an agent should normally:

1. inspect the resulting diff;
2. run relevant validation;
3. check documentation impact;
4. verify that no private data or secrets were introduced;
5. summarize important trade-offs or deliberate deviations.

## Exception Rule

When a methodology default conflicts with a better project outcome, use:

`Default → Conflict → Trade-off → Exception → Evidence → Revisit`

Deviation is allowed; unexplained deviation is not.
